{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/ea787dd9744861170c32172c92e31510.poster.avif?t=1760378494\" width=600 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/ea787dd9744861170c32172c92e31510.webm?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/ea787dd9744861170c32172c92e31510.mp4?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Don't know if you would like the game? Try the demo!</u></strong><br><br> <strong><u>ABOUT</u></strong><br>Unleash powerful spells, dodge intense bullet-hell attacks, and defeat formidable bosses in this action-packed rogue-lite RPG. Customize your hero with Pets, Perks, Classes, Cosmetics and <strong>MORE</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CONQUER EACH FLOOR</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, Blast, and Dodge your way up the tower with over 100+ unique spells. Each spell has a unique form and plays differently than the last. Whether you're freezing enemies with a glacial spike, or hurling meteors down on your foes, master them to melt through enemies and climb even higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/f700591b00b68bbc30a7d0b0268791d2.poster.avif?t=1760378494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/f700591b00b68bbc30a7d0b0268791d2.webm?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/f700591b00b68bbc30a7d0b0268791d2.mp4?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><u>BECOME SUPER POWERFUL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading a spell isn\u2019t just a stat boost, it\u2019s a transformation. Each upgrade reshapes the spell into something stronger, flashier, and way more fun. With most spells evolving across three tiers, you\u2019re free to go 'all-in' on your favorites, and unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.poster.avif?t=1760378494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.webm?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/07a737e6da38e4b9f6aa884a5b62e494.mp4?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong> <u>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BUILD</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's a new class, pet, perk, mask, or cosmetic, there are thousands of combinations to make each and every run feel fresh.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/8fe9ebc76320c18951d5d520bc37a429.poster.avif?t=1760378494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/8fe9ebc76320c18951d5d520bc37a429.webm?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/8fe9ebc76320c18951d5d520bc37a429.mp4?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>DISCOVER</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various NPC's that aid you on your path.\u00a0Seek out forgotten chambers, sacred masks, and powerful boss runes, each one pulsing with power and waiting to reshape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/8d803558dd3c198e81b9af650968df73.poster.avif?t=1760378494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/8d803558dd3c198e81b9af650968df73.webm?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/8d803558dd3c198e81b9af650968df73.mp4?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FACE THE CHALLENGE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the guardians of the tower in EPIC boss battles! Do you have what it takes to come out on top?<br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/6a020d87c45cc539b397d1565dedc924.poster.avif?t=1760378494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/6a020d87c45cc539b397d1565dedc924.webm?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/6a020d87c45cc539b397d1565dedc924.mp4?t=1760378494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way, with multiple unique classes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ distinct spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Dozens of meta-progression perks, pets, and NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Spell Upgrade System that <u><i>isn't</i></u> just a number increase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover NPC's in the tower that will help you face even greater threats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loads of Cosmetics that unlock via achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find dozens of masks each with a special unique ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Gacha <u><i>without</i></u> microtransactions. (In-game currency only)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss perks! - After defeating a boss, choose an additional perk to help you climb higher.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty options to tailor each run to your skill and mood.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3189770?t=1760378494","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/a743a354675789c9441107a7f1459f02a44d8f3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760378494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/0db0b1000d498246cabae381e0e89749332316f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760378494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/0db0b1000d498246cabae381e0e89749332316f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760378494","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"de